  "details": "The OnAvatarChanged() Udon event is fired when you finish IK calibration, when I dont really think it should be, as you havent actually changed avatars. Ideally, this behaviour would be changed so that OnAvatarChanged does *not* get called on IK recalibration, and then incase anyone is using it to detect IK Recalibration, maybe add in a event for that specifically",
